--   Description    : Tests different variants of pause frames (PFC or classic)

-- 1) all 5 frames are PFC, non-errored, none copied to memory, all with pause
--    frame interrupt
-- 2) all 5 frames are PFC, non-errored, all copied to memory, all with pause
--     and frame receive interrupt
-- 3) all 5 frames are PFC, some are errored, none copied to memory, only
--    non-errored frames with pause frame interrupt
-- 4) all 5 frames are PFC, some are errored, all copied to memory, only
--    non-errored frames with pause and frame received interrupt
-- 5) mix 5 frames of PFC and classic, non-errored, none copied to memory, only
--    PFC frames with pause frame interrupt
-- 6) mix 5 frames of PFC and classic, non-errored, all copied to memory, PFC
--    frames with pause and frame received interrupt, classic pause frames only
--    with frame received interrupt
-- 7) mix 5 frames of PFC and classic, some are errored, none copied to memory,
--   only non-errored PFC frames with pause frame interrupt
-- 8) mix 5 frames of PFC and classic, some are errored, all copied to memory,
--    only non-errored PFC frames with pause and frame received interrupt,
--		non-errored classic pause frame with frame received interrupt
 

